WARNING:DEVICE_ATTR_FUNCTIONS: Consider renaming function(s) 'sdev_show_delete' to 'delete_show' 'sdev_store_delete' to 'delete_store'
#120: FILE: drivers/scsi/scsi_sysfs.c:763:
